# ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# James Imbuido — Interactive Data Universe Portfolio
# Environment variables
#
# PHASE 0 NOTE: none of these are needed yet. The skeleton runs and
# deploys with zero environment variables. When a later phase needs a
# value, copy this file to .env.local and fill it in. .env.local is
# git-ignored and must never be committed (master plan §21).
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Supabase — Phase 5 (auth, credits, chess rewards) ──
# From Supabase Dashboard → Project Settings → API.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL="https://your-project-ref.supabase.co"
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY="your-anon-key"
# Server-only. Never expose to the browser, never commit.
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY="your-service-role-key"

# ── LLM provider — Phase 6 (JTB chatbot) ──
# Server-only. Must NEVER carry the NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix and must never
# reach the browser (master plan §21).
# LLM_API_KEY="your-llm-api-key"
